 "about_text": "Harkawik is a contemporary art gallery founded by curator and artist Peter Harkawik. The gallery grew out of large survey exhibitions Harkawik organized at guest venues through the 2010s before opening a permanent space in Los Angeles in 2018. It expanded to New York's Lower East Side in 2020, later moving into a larger Tribeca location in 2024. The gallery represents fifteen artists with a strong international focus, presenting work across painting, sculpture, and other media, alongside a program of exhibited artists shown in group shows but not formally represented.",
